### Norma (Normalization Tool)
{: class="first-heading"}

Norma is a tool for automatic spelling normalization of non-standard language
data, written in C++ with optional bindings for Python 2.

For more information, please visit the [separate website dedicated to
Norma](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/comphist/resources/norma/) or go directly
to its [public GitHub repository](https://github.com/fpetran/norma).
{:.alert.alert-info}
